      "description": "Elevate your everyday wardrobe with this classic checked shirt from Rare Rabbit. Crafted from a premium polyester blend, it offers comfort and durability for all-day wear. The spread collar and button-front design deliver a polished, versatile look perfect for casual outings or smart-casual occasions. The regular fit ensures a flattering silhouette, while the hue with checked pattern adds visual interest to your collection. A timeless piece that pairs effortlessly with jeans, chinos, or tailored trousers.- 53% Polyester 47% Cotton- Twill- Checked- Regular Fit- Full SleeveSIZEModel height 188cm. The model (Chest-39, Waist-32, Hips-38) is wearing a size M",
